# Local Context

See additional context files in ~/dev-context/[PROJECT_NAME]/:

- ~/dev-context/[PROJECT_NAME]/CONTEXT.md — domain rules, gotchas, how things connect
- ~/dev-context/[PROJECT_NAME]/CURRENT.md — current work, open questions, next step
- ~/dev-context/[PROJECT_NAME]/decisions/ — decision logs per domain area

Please read CONTEXT.md and CURRENT.md at the start of every session before touching any code.
